Package: rezoagwe
Version: _version_
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Vladislav Ananev <nexus.riot@gmail.com>
Depends: adduser
Description: Distributed KV store with chat (rendezvous + peer nodes)
 Eventually-consistent key-value store with per-key last-write-wins,
 anti-entropy reconciliation, compare-and-swap, key TTLs and an
 authenticated wire, plus an embedded chat.
 .
 Ships three binaries: rezoagwe-bootstrap, the rendezvous service;
 rezoagwe-discovery, a full peer node with a TUI and an HTTP gateway;
 and rezoagwectl, a client that drives a node through that gateway
 without joining the cluster. The two services have systemd units,
 neither enabled on install.
Installed-Size: 12000
